hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1703","###
 Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Yahya (meaning Ibn Sa'id) and Uthman (meaning Ibn 'Umar), who said: Ibn Abi Dh'ib narrated to us, from Sa'id ibn Abi Sa'd, from 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Sa'id al-Khudri, from his father, who said: ""We were detained on the Day of the Trench (Al-Khandaq) from performing the prayer until a portion of the night"
